config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBOGG
	bool "Ogg"
	help
	  Ogg is a multimedia container format, and the native file and
	  stream format for the Xiph.org multimedia codecs. As with all
	  Xiph.org technology is it an open format free for anyone to use.

	  http://xiph.org/ogg

